            "review_title": "Review at The Tasty House",
            "review_text": "Vu Ng\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam14 contributions\n0\nA hidden gem!\nSep 2026 • Family\nThe pizza, pasta, and salad here are excellent, with quality ingredients and authentic flavours. The smoothies are so fresh!\nThis cosy, family-owned restaurant is tucked away in a small, quiet street, offering a warm and inviting atmosphere. \nAll in all, a very satisfying dining experience!\nInsider tip:\nIf you visit on a busy night, expect a short wait for a table and your food. But it's completely understandable and totally worth it!\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten September 27, 2026",
